{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54042","headline":"王子颂五首 朝生 · 良价","name":"王子颂五首 朝生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苦学论情世不（《五灯会元》作「莫」）羣，出来凡事已超伦。\n诗成五字三冬雪，笔落分毫四海云。\n万卷积功彰圣代，一心忠孝辅明君。\n盐梅不是生知得，金榜何劳显至勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"良价","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}